ज्ञानं ज्ञेयं ज्ञानगम्यं हृदि सर्वस्य विष्ठितम् ॥ १८ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3707,\"bb\":3267,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/18/b3267/\",\"body_value\":\"jyotiṣām api taj jyotis
