विकारांश्च गुणांश्चैव विद्धि प्रकृतिसम्भवान् ॥ २० ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3723,\"bb\":3281,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/20/b3281/\",\"body_value\":\"prakṛtiṁ puruṣaṁ caiva
viddhy anādī ubhāv api
vikārāṁś ca guṇāṁś caiva
viddhi prakṛti-sambhavān\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3724,\"bb\":3282,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/20/b3282/\",\"shadow_value\":\"prakṛtim – material nature; puruṣam – the living entities; ca – also; eva – certainly; viddhi – you must know; anādī – without beginning; ubhau – both; api – also; vikārān – transformations; ca – also; guṇān – the three modes of nature; ca – also; eva – certainly; viddhi – know; prakṛti – material nature; sambhavān – produced of.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"prakṛtim\",\"translation\":\"material nature\"},{\"word\":\"puruṣam\",\"translation\":\"the living entities\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"viddhi\",\"translation\":\"you must know\"},{\"word\":\"anādī\",\"translation\":\"without beginning\"},{\"word\":\"ubhau\",\"translation\":\"both\"},{\"word\":\"api\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"vikārān\",\"translation\":\"transformations\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"guṇān\",\"translation\":\"the three modes of nature\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"viddhi\",\"translation\":\"know\"},{\"word\":\"prakṛti\",\"translation\":\"material nature\"},{\"word\":\"sambhavān\",\"translation\":\"produced of\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3725,\"bb\":3283,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/20/b3283/\",\"body_value\":\"Material nature and the living entities should be understood to be beginningless. Their transformations and the modes of matter are products of material nature.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3726,\"bb\":3284,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/20/b3284/\",\"body_value\":\"By the knowledge given in this chapter, one can understand the body (the field of activities) and the knowers of the body (both the individual soul and the Supersoul). The body is the field of activity and is composed of material nature. The individual soul that is embodied and enjoying the activities of the body is the puruṣa, or the living entity. He is one knower, and the other is the Supersoul. Of course, it is to be understood that both the Supersoul and the individual entity are different manifestations of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. The living entity is in the category of His energy, and the Supersoul is in the category of His personal expansion.\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3727,\"bb\":3285,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/13/20/b3285/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 13.20\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 13.20\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n26:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3